  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.743.6 describes use cases, service requirements and challenges of the next generation content delivery network (CDN). A reference architecture named access CDN for meeting these requirements and challenges, which decouples the common functions and customized services, is also defined.</abstract>
